---
subject: "Bem-vindo(a) ao Sistema de Cooperativas, {{firstName}}!"
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
  <title>Bem-vindo(a) ao Sistema de Cooperativas</title>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap');

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: #0f1117;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    .email-wrapper {
      background-color: #0f1117;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .email-container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }

    /* ── Header ── */
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1f2e 0%, #16213e 50%, #0d3b6e 100%);
      padding: 48px 40px 40px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(99, 179, 237, 0.15);
    }

    .header::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6, #60a5fa, #93c5fd, #60a5fa, #3b82f6);
    }

    .logo-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #3b82f6);
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
    }

    .logo-badge svg {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
    }

    .brand-name {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #60a5fa;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .header-title {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #f1f5f9;
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .header-subtitle {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    /* ── Body ── */
    .body {
      background-color: #12161f;
      padding: 40px;
    }

    .greeting {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .greeting span {
      color: #60a5fa;
    }

    .intro-text {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    /* ── Divider ── */
    .divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(99, 179, 237, 0.2), transparent);
      margin: 32px 0;
    }

    /* ── Feature Cards ── */
    .features-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #64748b;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .features-grid {
      display: table;
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: separate;
      border-spacing: 0 12px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      display: table-row;
    }

    .feature-icon-cell {
      display: table-cell;
      width: 48px;
      vertical-align: top;
      padding-right: 16px;
      padding-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .feature-icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 44px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .feature-icon-1 { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2); }
    .feature-icon-2 { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); }
    .feature-icon-3 { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2); }

    .feature-content-cell {
      display: table-cell;
      vertical-align: top;
      padding-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .feature-name {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .feature-desc {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #64748b;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* ── CTA ── */
    .cta-wrapper {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 36px 0 28px;
    }

    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #3b82f6);
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 14px 36px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.35);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    /* ── Info Box ── */
    .info-box {
      background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .info-box-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #3b82f6;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .info-box-text {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #64748b;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* ── Footer ── */
    .footer {
      background-color: #0d1117;
      padding: 28px 40px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    }

    .footer-brand {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #334155;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .footer-text {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #334155;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .footer-links {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .footer-links a {
      color: #475569;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-right: 16px;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover {
      color: #60a5fa;
    }

    .status-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #10b981;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .status-dot {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      background: #10b981;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: inline-block;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="email-wrapper">
    <div class="email-container">

      <!-- ── HEADER ── -->
      <div class="header">
        <div class="logo-badge">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 36 36" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M18 4L32 12V24L18 32L4 24V12L18 4Z" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.08)" stroke="#93c5fd" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M18 10L26 15V25L18 30L10 25V15L18 10Z" fill="rgba(59,130,246,0.3)" stroke="#60a5fa" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <circle cx="18" cy="20" r="4" fill="#fff"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="brand-name">Sistema de Cooperativas</p>
        <h1 class="header-title">Bem-vindo(a) à plataforma 🎉</h1>
        <p class="header-subtitle">Sua conta foi criada com sucesso</p>
      </div>

      <!-- ── BODY ── -->
      <div class="body">

        <div class="status-badge">
          <span class="status-dot"></span>
          Conta ativa
        </div>

        <p class="greeting">Olá, <span>{{firstName}}</span>!</p>

        <p class="intro-text">
          É um prazer ter você na nossa plataforma cooperativa. Sua conta foi configurada
          e você já tem acesso a todos os recursos disponíveis para cooperados. Explore
          o painel e aproveite tudo que preparamos para você.
        </p>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <!-- Features -->
        <p class="features-title">O que você pode fazer agora</p>

        <table class="features-grid" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation">
          <tr class="feature-card">
            <td class="feature-icon-cell">
              <div class="feature-icon feature-icon-1">🏦</div>
            </td>
            <td class="feature-content-cell">
              <p class="feature-name">Gestão Financeira</p>
              <p class="feature-desc">Visualize extratos, saldos e movimentações da sua cota cooperativa em tempo real.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="feature-card">
            <td class="feature-icon-cell">
              <div class="feature-icon feature-icon-2">📊</div>
            </td>
            <td class="feature-content-cell">
              <p class="feature-name">Relatórios & Análises</p>
              <p class="feature-desc">Acesse dashboards com indicadores de desempenho e distribuição de sobras.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="feature-card">
            <td class="feature-icon-cell">
              <div class="feature-icon feature-icon-3">🔔</div>
            </td>
            <td class="feature-content-cell">
              <p class="feature-name">Notificações Inteligentes</p>
              <p class="feature-desc">Receba alertas automáticos sobre assembleias, pagamentos e eventos da cooperativa.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <div class="cta-wrapper">
          <a href="http://localhost:8025" class="cta-button">
            Acessar Minha Conta →
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Info Box -->
        <div class="info-box">
          <p class="info-box-label">ℹ️ &nbsp;Precisa de ajuda?</p>
          <p class="info-box-text">
            Nossa equipe de suporte está disponível de segunda a sexta-feira, das 8h às 18h.
            Entre em contato pelo portal ou responda a este e-mail. Tempo médio de resposta: <strong style="color:#60a5fa">2 horas</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- ── FOOTER ── -->
      <div class="footer">
        <p class="footer-brand">Sistema de Cooperativas</p>
        <p class="footer-text">
          Você está recebendo este e-mail porque criou uma conta em nossa plataforma.
          Este é um e-mail automático — por favor, não responda diretamente.
        </p>
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a href="#">Política de Privacidade</a>
          <a href="#">Termos de Uso</a>
          <a href="#">Cancelar inscrição</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
